abstract: >
  Curiosity-driven computational research on Erdos problems and natural
  extensions, via SAT solving, exhaustive search, and Lean 4 formalization.
  Includes the coprime Ramsey numbers R_cop(3)=11, R_cop(3;3)=53, R_cop(4)=59,
  Schur-number extensions, and density-relaxed Schur numbers.
